flowchart TD
    A[Versioned synthetic decision records] --> B[Validate record structure and IDs]
    B --> C[Replay input against current policy]
    C --> D[Compare recorded and replayed decision fields]
    D --> E{Decision drift detected?}
    E -- No --> F[Report unchanged]
    E -- Yes --> G[Report changed fields]
    G --> H[Human review before policy release]
    F --> I[Preserve original record]
    H --> I
    I --> J[No actions executed and no history overwritten]
